  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-smithing-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Smithing-Tables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>更多鍛造台</h1>\n<p>現在每種木材都有專屬的鍛造台，讓你的建築充滿豐富多彩的工具和盔甲升級體驗。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Smithing-Tables/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>為 Minecraft 新增 12 種全新的<em>鍛造台</em>。</h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方塊替換功能：</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/wfhve.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n從平原村莊工具師的房屋窗口望向漁夫的小屋：我們可以看到，原本該是普通的<em>鍛造台</em>、<em>雲杉木桶</em>與一般<em>箱子</em>的地方，遊戲現在生成村莊時已改為<em><strong>橡木鍛造台</strong></em>、<em><strong>橡木桶</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-barrel-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多桶變體</a>）以及<em><strong>橡木箱子</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-chest-variants-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多箱子變體</a>）。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
